note scl_@T@: d = x*s + b on @T@ f32 lanes (s, b f32 bits); b 0 gives the plain x*s of ggml_vec_scale_f32.
fn scl_@T@ x view f32 @T@ d edit f32 @T@ s ulong b ulong to void
sf = bitcast f32 uint s
bf = bitcast f32 uint b
for i ulong @T@
v = mul get x i sf
if ne b 0
v = add v bf
end
put d i v
end
end
